abstract:
We present a search for the decays $B^{+} 	o \mu^{+} 
u_{\mu}$ and $B^{+} 	o e^{+} 
u_{e}$ in a 253 fb$^{-1}$ data sample collected at the $\Upsilon(4S)$ resonance with the Belle detector at the KEKB asymmetric energy $e^{+} e^{-}$ collider. We observe no evidence for signal and set 90% confidence level upper limits of $\mathcal{B}(B^{+} 	o \mu^{+} 
u_{\mu}) < 1.7 	imes 10^{-6}$ and $\mathcal{B}(B^{+} 	o e^{+} 
u_{e}) < 9.8 	imes 10^{-7}$.
